{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/extras/496715b1419e114518e080b6a82f83e6.avif?t=1774068450\" width=1290 height=223 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manic Meeples is a deck-building strategy rogue-like! It takes the basic pieces from chess but adds over SEVENDY MORE unique pieces (which we call meeples) to discover!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get it wrong- this is NOT chess and it DOESN'T PLAY like chess, either! Chess is BORING, so we made it better!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the king alive. If he dies then the RUN ENDS!!! Simultaneously, destroying all of the enemies on the board means you'll win the battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through multiple different unique areas, from cute forests to DASTARDLY VOLCANOES!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/extras/e9e48942e4c0d5192accf79953561f1a.avif?t=1774068450\" width=1056 height=203 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across your run, you'll encounter countless new editions to your collection. Wizards, jesters, ancient Greek gods, assassins, ghosts, banana splits, and more!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each meeple has a completely unique set of skills and abilities, allowing for creative combos, synergies, and play styles from run to run!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/extras/b70eeb062ba85b85ad9ab1238d8b24ab.avif?t=1774068450\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/extras_big/b70eeb062ba85b85ad9ab1238d8b24ab.webp?t=1774068450 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like you and your BRAND NEW meeples, your enemies have increased their game. Every area provides a new pool of baddies, each stronger than the last. Be wary!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These enemies were ripped from completely different board games without a choice, so they're kinda cranky. Knock some sense into them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLUS, you'll encounter BIG BAD BOSSES that are sure to give you a big bad beat down!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3996050?t=1774068450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/873beaeda20deb203ba16fb6f83f3a6a14a668b6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774068450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/b68bed94fc5b13e0d610dd5644a84e09e99b6f62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774068450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/b68bed94fc5b13e0d610dd5644a84e09e99b6f62/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774068450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/extras/496715b1419e114518e080b6a82f83e6.avif?t=1774068450\" width=1290 height=223 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manic Meeples is a deck-building strategy rogue-like! It takes the basic pieces from chess but adds over SEVENDY MORE unique pieces (which we call meeples) to discover!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get it wrong- this is NOT chess and it DOESN'T PLAY like chess, either! Chess is BORING, so we made it better!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the king alive. If he dies then the RUN ENDS!!! Simultaneously, destroying all of the enemies on the board means you'll win the battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through multiple different unique areas, from cute forests to DASTARDLY VOLCANOES!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/extras/e9e48942e4c0d5192accf79953561f1a.avif?t=1774068450\" width=1056 height=203 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across your run, you'll encounter countless new editions to your collection. Wizards, jesters, ancient Greek gods, assassins, ghosts, banana splits, and more!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each meeple has a completely unique set of skills and abilities, allowing for creative combos, synergies, and play styles from run to run!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/extras/b70eeb062ba85b85ad9ab1238d8b24ab.avif?t=1774068450\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/extras_big/b70eeb062ba85b85ad9ab1238d8b24ab.webp?t=1774068450 width=1560 height=254 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like you and your BRAND NEW meeples, your enemies have increased their game. Every area provides a new pool of baddies, each stronger than the last. Be wary!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These enemies were ripped from completely different board games without a choice, so they're kinda cranky. Knock some sense into them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLUS, you'll encounter BIG BAD BOSSES that are sure to give you a big bad beat down!</p></li></ul>","developers":["BerryBush"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3996050/339d9eaa5f7b6e1f6ca397c643425f667c4e4730/header.jpg?t=1774068450","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3996050/322994691/1129155c5dc8ee4d78f26fbfde737ccad5f55fb5/1760226016/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760227900","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3996050/322994691/1129155c5dc8ee4d78f26fbfde737ccad5f55fb5/1760226016/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760227900","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3996050/322994691/1129155c5dc8ee4d78f26fbfde737ccad5f55fb5/1760226016/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760227900","id":257197783,"name":"Manic Meeples Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257197783/0aec189ccf3523f2bc02f3148e486c2c6c039873/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760227900"}],"name":"Manic Meeples","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10, or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128 MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["BerryBush"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-